Rule text: Every car must wait at least 1.5 seconds in the waiting zone before it crosses the stop line.
Current DWELL: min_ms=800.0, max_speed=0.08 (only time while the car's center moves at most max_speed frame widths per second, measured over 1/3 s, counts; the run must be continuous). Truth: a car that crosses must have stood still >= 1.0 s.
